<title>DUBAI: King Fahd ask Saudis to pray for rain.</title>
<headline>King Fahd ask Saudis to pray for rain.</headline>
<dateline>DUBAI 1996-11-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>King Fahd of Saudi Arabia has urged his subjects to pray for rainfall in the water-parched kingdom on Monday, local newspapers said on Saturday.</p>
<p>Winter rains in Saudi Arabia normally arrive by the end of October.</p>
</text>
